                            POSITION RECOVERY • HOMING • JAM CLEARING • HMI INTERFACE

========================================================================================================================
 Project:       Roller Door PLC Program
 Description:   Automatic opening and closing with position control,
                jam detection, jam clearing, homing, auto-commisioning and PAR-5 HMI supported
 Author:        Max Placidi
 Version:       1.0
 Date:          04/08/2026

 Program Sections
 1. Track limit detection
 2. Jam detection     
 3. Loading parameters
 4. Parameter box display and information
 5. State machine
 6. Fault clearing
 7. Homing 
 8. Movement, power and current position assignment saving

========================================================================================================================

PARAMETER OVERWRITES:
P480[09] = Reference point [23]
P481[09] = Output via PLC  [40]

ADJUSTABLE PARAMETERS:
P355[01] = Variable - RunFreq                                           [Test value: 2000]  Fraction out of 16384
P355[02] = Variable - ClearFreq                                         [Test value: 3500]  Fraction out of 16384
P355[03] = Variable - TorqueLimitUp                                     [Test value: 2]     Unit is deciamps
P355[04] = Variable - TorqueLimitDown                                   [Test value: 2]     Unit is deciamps
P355[05] = Variable - MaxJams                                           [Test value: 5]
P355[06] = Variable - HomeFreq                                          [Test value: 2000]  Fraction out of 16384
P355[07] = Variable - FloorDeadZone                                     [Test value: 100]   Unit is millirevs
P355[08] = Variable - TopDeadZone                                       [Test value: 100]   Unit is millirevs
P355[09] = Variable - HomingTorqueLimit                                 [Test value: 2]     Unit is deciamps
P355[10] = Variable - ConfigSelect

P356[01] = Last saved position. Loaded in during drive initialisation   [Test value: 100]   Unit is millirevs
P356[02] = Variable - EndPos                                            [Test value: 10000] Unit is millirevs
P356[03] = Variable - RestTime                                          [Test value: 2000]  Unit is milliseconds
P356[04] = Variable - JamTime                                           [Test value: 2000]  Unit is milliseconds

Assumes top sensor is digital input 5 
And bottom is         digital input 6

CONTROLS:
DI1 OR Parameter box up: Door open
DI2 OR Parameter box down: Force door closed OR Reference point during homing
DI5: Test jam signal
DI6 OR (Parameter box ok + Parameter box on): Initiate homing

ERRORS:
E23 Flag 1: Max jam clearing attempts reached.
    Flag 2: DI5 triggered (top sensor)
    Flag 3: DI6 triggered (bottom sensor)
========================================================================================================================*)

(* *************************************************************** *)
(*                          MAIN PROGRAM                           *)
(* *************************************************************** *)

(* Further memory optimisation draft; original motion and parameter-write order retained.
   - Shared numeric display format setup; state display explicitly restores POINT=0.
   - Five ParameterBox R_TRIG instances replaced by a byte-wide rising-edge mask.
   - Digital-limit and conditional torque R_TRIG instances are retained.
   - StartPos=0 and WritePosExecute=TRUE are invariant and no longer stored as variables.
   - Fixed HMI repeat/blink timings are VAR CONSTANT.
   - Repeated jam-pause, jam-entry, scrolling and key-repeat logic is merged.
   - Parameter-write instances, concurrency, RAMONLY flags and EXECUTE sequencing are unchanged.
   - Existing HMI page/value mappings and repeated CLEAR behaviour are deliberately retained.

   Not compiled or commissioned in NORDCON. Check resource consumption after compiling.
   Test startup/reset, opening/closing, held/simultaneous keys, all edit/display pages,
   both homing ends, jams in states 1/3/4/6, timer boundaries and power-loss recovery.
   Ordinary PLC logic is not a substitute for safety-rated stopping/interlocks.

   Reference: NORD BU 0550, sections 4.3.4.4 (pp.84-85), 4.3.6.2 (pp.99-101),
   4.4.3 (pp.129-131), 4.6.2.1-2 (pp.175-177); BU 0000, section 11.2.2.4 (p.77).
*)

(*1. --------------------Track Limit detection----------------------*)

(*Top sensor*)
DI5Edge(CLK:=_5_State_digital_input.4);

(*Bottom sensor*)
DI6Edge(CLK:=_5_State_digital_input.5);

IF NOT IsHoming THEN
        (*Exceeded Top*)
        IF DI5Edge.Q THEN
                _110_ErrorFlags.1 := TRUE;        
        END_IF;
        
        (*Exceeded bottom*)
        IF DI6Edge.Q THEN
                _110_ErrorFlags.2 := TRUE; 
        END_IF;
END_IF; 

(*2. ------------------------Jam detection-----------------------------*)                                                                                          
IF ((_90_Actual_torque_current > TorqueLimitUp) 
OR (_90_Actual_torque_current < -TorqueLimitDown)) 
AND NOT IsHoming AND Power THEN
        
        (* Shared opening / reopening jam actions. *)
        IF (State = 1)
        OR (((State = 4) OR (State = 6)) AND (_90_Actual_torque_current > 0)) THEN
                JamTimer(IN := FALSE);
                MoveExecute := FALSE;
                JamCount := JamCount + 1;
                IF State = 1 THEN
                        State := 5;
                ELSE
                        State := 6;
                END_IF;

        (*Jamming when closing*)        
        ELSIF (State = 3) AND (_90_Actual_torque_current < 0) THEN 
                JamCount := JamCount + 1;
                SetFreq := ClearFreq;
                MoveExecute := FALSE;
                Power := FALSE;
                                                
                State := 4; (*Clear jam after going down*)
        END_IF;          
END_IF;

(*3. --------------------Loading parameters---------------------*)
IF NOT Init THEN
        
        (*Loading position*)
        EndPos := _126_PLC_P356_2;
        TargetPos := EndPos;
        MoveExecute := FALSE;
        Power := FALSE;
        
        (*Restores position from memory*)
        IF (_125_PLC_P356_1 > FloorDeadZone) 
        AND (_125_PLC_P356_1 < (EndPos - TopDeadZone)) THEN
                ResetPos(
                        EXECUTE := TRUE, 
                        POSITION := _125_PLC_P356_1
                );                
        END_IF;
        
        (*Other presets*)
        RestTime :=  _127_PLC_P356_3;
        JamTime := _128_PLC_P356_4;
        
        RunFreq := _115_PLC_P355_1;
        ClearFreq := _116_PLC_P355_2;
        TorqueLimitUp := _117_PLC_P355_3;
        TorqueLimitDown := _118_PLC_P355_4;
        MaxJams := _119_PLC_P355_5;
        HomeFreq := _120_PLC_P355_6;
        FloorDeadZone := INT_TO_DINT(_121_PLC_P355_7);
        TopDeadZone := INT_TO_DINT(_122_PLC_P355_8);
        HomingTorqueLimit := _123_PLC_P355_9;
        
        (*Sets the parameters to enable autohoming*)
        ParamInit := 1;
        
        ConfigSelect := _124_PLC_P355_10;

        Init := TRUE;
ELSE
        (*Writing position*)
        WritePos(
                EXECUTE := (State <> 0),
                PARAMETERNUMBER := 356,
                PARAMETERINDEX := 0,
                VALUE := _145_Actual_pos,
                RAMONLY := 0
        );

        IF WritePos.Done OR WritePos.Error THEN
                WritePos(EXECUTE := FALSE);
        END_IF;
END_IF;

(*Writes correct parameters upon initialisation*)
(*Map each commissioning step to parameter number, index and value*)
CASE ParamInit OF
        1:
                Line1Val := 480;
                Line2Val := 8;
                Line3Val := 23;

        2:
                Line1Val := 481;
                Line2Val := 8;
                Line3Val := 40;

        3:
                Line1Val := 600;
                Line2Val := 0;
                Line3Val := 2;

        4:
                Line1Val := 553;
                Line2Val := 0;
                Line3Val := 1;

        5:
                Line1Val := 553;
                Line2Val := 1;
                Line3Val := 21;

        6:
                Line1Val := 553;
                Line2Val := 2;
                Line3Val := 22;
END_CASE;


(*Perform one write at a time*)
IF (ParamInit >= 1) AND (ParamInit <= 6) THEN

        WriteParam(
                EXECUTE := TRUE,
                PARAMETERNUMBER := DINT_TO_INT(Line1Val),
                PARAMETERINDEX := DINT_TO_INT(Line2Val),
                VALUE := DINT_TO_INT(Line3Val),
                RAMONLY := 1
        );

        IF WriteParam.Done THEN
                WriteParam(EXECUTE := FALSE);

                IF ParamInit = 6 THEN
                        ParamInit := 0;
                ELSE
                        ParamInit := ParamInit + 1;
                END_IF;
        END_IF;

ELSE
        WriteParam(EXECUTE := FALSE);
END_IF;


(*Preset selection: each CASE entry defines an independent set of values.
  All presets reuse the ConfigInit parameter-saving sequence below.
  Add further entries here with the required predetermined values;
  finish each accepted entry with ConfigInit := 1; ConfigSelect := 0;
  Unlisted selections leave the settings and saving sequence unchanged.*)
CASE ConfigSelect OF
        1:      (*Test config*)
                RunFreq := 2000;
                ClearFreq := 3500;
                TorqueLimitUp := 2;
                TorqueLimitDown := 2;
                MaxJams := 5;
                HomeFreq := 2000;
                FloorDeadZone := 100;
                TopDeadZone := 100;
                HomingTorqueLimit := 2;
                
                EndPos := 10000;
                RestTime := 2000;
                JamTime := 2000;
                
                ConfigInit := 1;
                ConfigSelect := 0;
                
        2:      (*Door 2*)
                RunFreq := 2000;
                ClearFreq := 3500;
                TorqueLimitUp := 2;
                TorqueLimitDown := 2;
                MaxJams := 5;
                HomeFreq := 2000;
                FloorDeadZone := 100;
                TopDeadZone := 100;
                HomingTorqueLimit := 2;
                
                EndPos := 10000;
                RestTime := 2000;
                JamTime := 2000;
                
                ConfigInit := 1;
                ConfigSelect := 0;
                
        3:      (*Door 3*)
                RunFreq := 2000;
                ClearFreq := 3500;
                TorqueLimitUp := 2;
                TorqueLimitDown := 2;
                MaxJams := 5;
                HomeFreq := 2000;
                FloorDeadZone := 100;
                TopDeadZone := 100;
                HomingTorqueLimit := 2;
                
                EndPos := 10000;
                RestTime := 2000;
                JamTime := 2000;
                
                ConfigInit := 1;
                ConfigSelect := 0;
                
        4:      (*Door 4*)
                RunFreq := 2000;
                ClearFreq := 3500;
                TorqueLimitUp := 2;
                TorqueLimitDown := 2;
                MaxJams := 5;
                HomeFreq := 2000;
                FloorDeadZone := 100;
                TopDeadZone := 100;
                HomingTorqueLimit := 2;
                
                EndPos := 10000;
                RestTime := 2000;
                JamTime := 2000;
                
                ConfigInit := 1;
                ConfigSelect := 0;
                
        5:      (*Door 5*)
                RunFreq := 2000;
                ClearFreq := 3500;
                TorqueLimitUp := 2;
                TorqueLimitDown := 2;
                MaxJams := 5;
                HomeFreq := 2000;
                FloorDeadZone := 100;
                TopDeadZone := 100;
                HomingTorqueLimit := 2;
                
                EndPos := 10000;
                RestTime := 2000;
                JamTime := 2000;
                
                ConfigInit := 1;
                ConfigSelect := 0;
                
        6:      (*Door 6*)
                RunFreq := 2000;
                ClearFreq := 3500;
                TorqueLimitUp := 2;
                TorqueLimitDown := 2;
                MaxJams := 5;
                HomeFreq := 2000;
                FloorDeadZone := 100;
                TopDeadZone := 100;
                HomingTorqueLimit := 2;
                
                EndPos := 10000;
                RestTime := 2000;
                JamTime := 2000;
                
                ConfigInit := 1;
                ConfigSelect := 0;       
END_CASE;

(*If the PLC parameters are all blank, it writes the test values to them*)
(*Select the value for the current write step*)
CASE ConfigInit OF
        1:  Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(RunFreq);
        2:  Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(ClearFreq);
        3:  Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(TorqueLimitUp);
        4:  Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(TorqueLimitDown);
        5:  Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(MaxJams);
        6:  Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(HomeFreq);
        7:  Line1Val := FloorDeadZone;
        8:  Line1Val := TopDeadZone;
        9:  Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(HomingTorqueLimit);
        10: Line1Val := 0;
        11: Line1Val := EndPos;
        12: Line1Val := RestTime;
        13: Line1Val := JamTime;
END_CASE;


(*Steps 1-9 write P355 indexes 0-8*)
IF (ConfigInit >= 1) AND (ConfigInit <= 9) THEN

        SavePar16(
                EXECUTE := TRUE,
                PARAMETERNUMBER := 355,
                PARAMETERINDEX := ConfigInit - 1,
                VALUE := DINT_TO_INT(Line1Val),
                RAMONLY := 0
        );

        SavePar32(EXECUTE := FALSE);

        IF SavePar16.Done THEN
                SavePar16(EXECUTE := FALSE);
                ConfigInit := ConfigInit + 1;
        END_IF;


(*Steps 10-13 write P356 indexes 0-3*)
ELSIF (ConfigInit >= 10) AND (ConfigInit <= 13) THEN

        SavePar16(EXECUTE := FALSE);

        SavePar32(
                EXECUTE := TRUE,
                PARAMETERNUMBER := 356,
                PARAMETERINDEX := ConfigInit - 10,
                VALUE := Line1Val,
                RAMONLY := 0
        );

        IF SavePar32.Done THEN
                SavePar32(EXECUTE := FALSE);

                IF ConfigInit = 13 THEN
                        ConfigInit := 0;
                ELSE
                        ConfigInit := ConfigInit + 1;
                END_IF;
        END_IF;

ELSE
        SavePar16(EXECUTE := FALSE);
        SavePar32(EXECUTE := FALSE);
END_IF;

(*4. ----------------------------Display and information--------------------------------*)

(*Defines moving from the running page to the parameter pages.*)
(* All five key edges share the same process-image snapshot. *)
KeyRise := _72_Parameterbox_key_state AND NOT PreviousKeys;
PreviousKeys := _72_Parameterbox_key_state;

IF KeyRise.6 AND (Page <= 0) THEN
        Page := ABS(Page);
        ClearDisplay := TRUE;
END_IF;

IF KeyRise.7 AND (Page >= 1) THEN
        Page := -ABS(Page);
        ClearDisplay := TRUE;
END_IF;


(* Common numeric-display inputs: assigned before every rendering pass.
   Each numeric call retains its original ENABLE, ROW and VALUE. *)
PBoxValue.MODE := BYTE#0;
PBoxValue.COLUMN := BYTE#12;
PBoxValue.POINT := BYTE#0;
PBoxValue.LENGTH := BYTE#6;

CASE Page OF                       
        1: (*Page 1*)
                (*
                        Line 1: Running frequency
                        Line 2: Frequency used to pull door up after encountering a jam going down.
                        Line 3: Torque current limit for faults going up
                        Line 4: Torque current limit for faults going down
                *)
                
                (*First entry deploys label string*)                                                                                                    
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L1Enabled, CLEAR := ClearDisplay, ROW := 0,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := RunFreqStr);
                (*Second entry deploys actual value*)  
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L1Enabled, ROW := 0,
                        VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(RunFreq) * 100000 / 16384000);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := ClearDisplay, ROW := 0,COLUMN := 18,
                        TEXT := PercentChar);
                (*Third entry is the end character to simulate a scroll bar*)
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := ClearDisplay, ROW := 0,COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := EndChar);
                
                (*Same for all 4 rows*)        
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L2Enabled, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 1, COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := ClearFreqStr);       
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L2Enabled, ROW := 1,
                        VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(ClearFreq) * 100000 / 16384000);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := ClearDisplay, ROW := 1,COLUMN := 18,
                        TEXT := PercentChar);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 1, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := MidChar);         
                        
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L3Enabled, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 2, COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := TorqueLimitUpStr);   
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L3Enabled, ROW := 2,
                        VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(TorqueLimitUp));
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 2, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := MidChar);        
                        
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L4Enabled, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 3, COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := TorqueLimitDownStr);       
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L4Enabled, ROW := 3,
                        VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(TorqueLimitDown));
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 3, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := DownArrowChar);
                                                                                                                                    
                Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(RunFreq) * 10000 / 1638400; 
                Line2Val := INT_TO_DINT(ClearFreq) * 100000 / 16384000;
                Line3Val := INT_TO_DINT(TorqueLimitUp);
                Line4Val := INT_TO_DINT(TorqueLimitDown);      
                               
        2: (*Page 2*)
                (*
                        Line 1: Maximum number of jams in a cycle before fault is thrown
                        Line 2: Frequency used during homing
                        Line 3: Floor dead zone
                        Line 4: Ceiling dead zone       
                *)
                
                (*First entry deploys label string*)                       
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L1Enabled,CLEAR := ClearDisplay,ROW := 0,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := MaxJamsStr);
                (*Second entry deploys actual value*)                        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L1Enabled,ROW := 0,
                        VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(MaxJams));
                (*Third entry is the end character to simulate a scroll bar*)        
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 0, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := UpArrowChar);
                
                (*Same for all 4 rows*)  
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L2Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 1,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := HomeFreqStr);        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L2Enabled,ROW := 1,
                        VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(HomeFreq) * 100000 / 16384000);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := ClearDisplay, ROW := 1,COLUMN := 18,
                        TEXT := PercentChar);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 1, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := MidChar);
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L3Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 2,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := FloorDeadZoneStr);        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L3Enabled,ROW := 2,
                        VALUE := FloorDeadZone);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 2, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := MidChar);
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L4Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 3,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := TopDeadZoneStr);       
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L4Enabled,ROW := 3,
                        VALUE := TopDeadZone);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 3, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := DownArrowChar);
                
                Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(MaxJams);
                Line2Val := INT_TO_DINT(HomeFreq) * 100000 / 16384000; 
                Line3Val := FloorDeadZone;
                Line4Val := TopDeadZone;   
                
        3: (*Page 3*)
                (*
                        Line 1: Torque limit to mark reference point during homing
                        Line 2: End position (ceiling position in millirevolutions)
                        Line 3: Pause duration when reaching ceiling
                        Line 4: Time spent off after encountering a jam going up
                *)
        
                (*First entry deploys label string*)  
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L1Enabled,CLEAR := ClearDisplay,ROW := 0,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := HomeTorqueLimitStr);
                (*Second entry deploys actual value*)                        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L1Enabled,ROW := 0,
                        VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(HomingTorqueLimit));
                (*Third entry is the end character to simulate a scroll bar*)        
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 0, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := UpArrowChar);
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L2Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 1,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := EndPosStr);        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L2Enabled,ROW := 1,
                        VALUE := EndPos);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 1, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := MidChar); 
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L3Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 2,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := RestTimeStr);        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L3Enabled,ROW := 2,
                        VALUE := RestTime);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 2, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := MidChar);
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L4Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 3,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := JamTimeStr);       
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L4Enabled,ROW := 3,
                        VALUE := JamTime);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := ClearDisplay, ROW := 3,COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := DownArrowChar);
                
                Line1Val := INT_TO_DINT(HomingTorqueLimit); 
                Line2Val := INT_TO_DINT(ConfigSelect);
                Line3Val := EndPos;
                Line4Val := RestTime;
        
        4: (*Page 4*)
                (*
                        Line 1: Time spent off after encountering a jam going up
                        Line 2: Saved position used to restore position in case of shutdown
                        Line 3: Blank
                        Line 4: Blank
                *)
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L1Enabled,CLEAR := ClearDisplay,ROW := 0,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := JamTimeStr);
                (*Second entry deploys actual value*)                        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L1Enabled,ROW := 0,
                        VALUE := JamTime);
                (*Third entry is the end character to simulate a scroll bar*)        
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 0, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := UpArrowChar);
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L2Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 1,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := ConfigSelectStr);        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L2Enabled,ROW := 1,
                        VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(ConfigSelect));
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 1, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := MidChar); 
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L3Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 2,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := BlankString);        
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L3Enabled,ROW := 2,
                        VALUE := 0);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := FALSE, ROW := 2, COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := MidChar);
                
                PBoxText(ENABLE := L4Enabled,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 3,COLUMN := 0,
                        TEXT := BlankString);       
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := L4Enabled,ROW := 3,
                        VALUE := 0);
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE, CLEAR := ClearDisplay, ROW := 3,COLUMN := 19,
                        TEXT := EndChar);
                        
                        
                Line1Val := JamTime;
                Line2Val := _125_PLC_P356_1;
                Line3Val := 0;   
                Line4Val := 0;
ELSE                
        IsParBoxOn := TRUE;
                
        (*Parameterbox rows on the main operating page*)
        PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE,CLEAR := ClearDisplay,ROW := 0,COLUMN := 0,TEXT := RunPageL0);
        PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 1,COLUMN := 0,TEXT := RunPageL1);
        PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 2,COLUMN := 0,TEXT := RunPageL2);
        PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := 3,COLUMN := 0,TEXT := RunPageL0);
                                
        (*Row 3 position update*)
        PBoxValue(ENABLE := TRUE,ROW := 2,COLUMN := 3,POINT := 3,LENGTH := 8,
                VALUE := _145_Actual_pos);
        (*Row 3 state update*)
        PBoxValue(ENABLE := TRUE,ROW := 2,COLUMN := 16,POINT := BYTE#0,LENGTH := 2,
                VALUE := INT_TO_DINT(State));                
END_CASE;

ClearDisplay := FALSE;


(*Handles UI logic on the parameter page*)
IF Page > 0 THEN
        IsParBoxOn := FALSE;                  
        
        (*Detects the OK button press*)                                                                                                                                                        
        IF KeyRise.5 THEN
                (*If a value wasn't being edited before, that means the user wants to edit the selected value now*)
                IF IsEditing = FALSE THEN
                        IsEditing := TRUE;
                                                
                        CASE RowIndex OF
                                0: EditBuffer := Line1Val;
                                1: EditBuffer := Line2Val;
                                2: EditBuffer := Line3Val;
                                3: EditBuffer := Line4Val;
                        END_CASE; 
                                                  
                ELSE (*If a user was already editing a value, we then want the current value to save*)
                        IsEditing := FALSE;
                        L1Enabled := TRUE;
                        FlashTimer(IN:=FALSE);
                                                
                        (*Convert percentages back into a usable value before saving*)
                        IF ((Page = 1) AND ((RowIndex = 0) OR (RowIndex = 1)))
                        OR ((Page = 2) AND (RowIndex = 1)) THEN
                                IF EditBuffer > 100 THEN
                                        EditBuffer := 100;
                                END_IF;

                                IF EditBuffer < 0 THEN
                                        EditBuffer := 0;
                                END_IF;

                                EditBuffer := (EditBuffer * DINT#4096) / DINT#25 + DINT#1;        
                        END_IF;
                        
                        (*Save Position*)
                        IsSaving := TRUE;
                                                
                        CASE RowIndex OF
                                0: Line1Val := EditBuffer;
                                1: Line2Val := EditBuffer;
                                2: Line3Val := EditBuffer;
                                3: Line4Val := EditBuffer;
                        END_CASE; 
                                                
                END_IF;        
        END_IF;
        
        (*User is adjusting parameter*)                
        IF IsEditing THEN
                (* Up retains priority when both keys are held. *)
                IF _72_Parameterbox_key_state.3 OR _72_Parameterbox_key_state.4 THEN
                        IF _72_Parameterbox_key_state.3 THEN
                                IF KeyRise.3 THEN
                                        Inc := 0;
                                        IncLvl := 1;
                                        EditBuffer := EditBuffer + 1;
                                END_IF;
                        ELSE
                                IF KeyRise.4 THEN
                                        Inc := 0;
                                        IncLvl := 1;
                                        EditBuffer := MAX(EditBuffer - 1, 0);
                                END_IF;
                        END_IF;

                        IncTimer(IN := TRUE, PT := IncTime);
                        IF IncTimer.Q THEN
                                Inc := Inc + IncLvl;
                                IncTimer(IN := FALSE);
                                IF _72_Parameterbox_key_state.3 THEN
                                        EditBuffer := EditBuffer + INT_TO_DINT(Inc);
                                ELSE
                                        EditBuffer := MAX(EditBuffer - INT_TO_DINT(Inc), 0);
                                END_IF;
                        END_IF;

                        IF IncLvl MOD 5 = 0 THEN
                                IncLvl := IncLvl * IncLvl * IncLvl + 5;
                        END_IF;
                ELSE
                        IncTimer(IN := FALSE);
                        Inc := 0;
                        IncLvl := 1;
                END_IF;

                (*Adujsted new value is displayed*)                  
                PBoxValue(ENABLE := TRUE,ROW := INT_TO_BYTE(RowIndex),COLUMN := 12,POINT := 0,LENGTH := 6,
                        VALUE := (EditBuffer));
                
               (*To let the user know editing mode is triggered, the name of the parameter is flashed at FlashTime*2 Hertz*)                                                   
                FlashTimer(IN:=NOT FlashTimer.Q, PT:=FlashTime);               
                IF FlashTimer.Q THEN
                        CASE RowIndex OF
                                0: CurrentLineEnabled := L1Enabled;
                                1: CurrentLineEnabled := L2Enabled;
                                2: CurrentLineEnabled := L3Enabled;
                                3: CurrentLineEnabled := L4Enabled;
                        END_CASE;
                        
                        (*Wipes the parameter name string to create flashing effect*)                        
                        IF CurrentLineEnabled THEN
                                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE,CLEAR := ClearDisplay,ROW := INT_TO_BYTE(RowIndex),COLUMN := 1,
                                TEXT := BlankString); 
                        END_IF;
                        CurrentLineEnabled := NOT CurrentLineEnabled;
                                                
                        CASE RowIndex OF
                                0: L1Enabled := CurrentLineEnabled;
                                1: L2Enabled := CurrentLineEnabled;
                                2: L3Enabled := CurrentLineEnabled;
                                3: L4Enabled := CurrentLineEnabled;
                        END_CASE;     
                END_IF;        
                                                                
        ELSE
                (*Scrolling functionality per row*)                
                CASE RowIndex OF
                        0:      
                                L1Enabled := TRUE;
                                IF KeyRise.3 AND (Page > 1) THEN
                                        RowIndex := 3; 
                                        Page := Page - 1;    
                                        ClearDisplay := TRUE;    
                                END_IF;
                                IF KeyRise.4 AND (Page < 5) THEN
                                        RowIndex := RowIndex + 1;        
                                END_IF;
                                                        
                        1, 2:
                                IF RowIndex = 1 THEN
                                        L2Enabled := TRUE;
                                ELSE
                                        L3Enabled := TRUE;
                                END_IF;
                                IF KeyRise.3 THEN
                                        RowIndex := RowIndex - 1;
                                END_IF;
                                IF KeyRise.4 THEN
                                        RowIndex := RowIndex + 1;
                                END_IF;
                        3: 
                                L4Enabled := TRUE;
                                IF KeyRise.3 THEN
                                        RowIndex := RowIndex - 1;      
                                END_IF;
                                IF KeyRise.4 AND (Page < 4) THEN
                                        RowIndex := 0;
                                        Page := Page + 1; 
                                        ClearDisplay := TRUE;     
                                END_IF;
                END_CASE;
                                        
                FlashTimer(IN:=FALSE);
                                                                
        END_IF;
                                
        (*Inserts the '>' character on the selected row during scrolling, and '*' during editing mode*)
        IF NOT IsEditing THEN
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := INT_TO_BYTE(RowIndex),COLUMN := 0,
                TEXT := SelChar);
        ELSE
                PBoxText(ENABLE := TRUE,CLEAR := FALSE,ROW := INT_TO_BYTE(RowIndex),COLUMN := 0,
                TEXT := ModChar);
        END_IF;
        
END_IF;

(*Parameter 355 indexes take 16 bit values*)
SavePar16(
        EXECUTE := IsSaving AND ((Page = 1) OR (Page = 2) OR ((Page = 3) AND (RowIndex = 0))) AND (State <> 0),
        PARAMETERNUMBER := 355,
        PARAMETERINDEX := (RowIndex + 4 * (Page - 1)),
        VALUE := DINT_TO_INT(EditBuffer),
        RAMONLY := 0
);   

(*Parameter 356 indexes take 32 bit values*)                        
SavePar32(
        EXECUTE := IsSaving AND (((Page = 3) AND (RowIndex > 1)) OR ((Page = 4) AND (RowIndex < 2))) AND (State <> 0),
        PARAMETERNUMBER := 356,
        PARAMETERINDEX := (RowIndex - 2*(3-Page) - 1),
        VALUE := EditBuffer,
        RAMONLY := 0
);          

IF SavePar16.Done OR SavePar16.Error OR SavePar32.Done OR SavePar32.Error THEN
        IsSaving := FALSE;
        Init := FALSE;
END_IF;


(*5. -----------------------------Drive state machine------------------------------*)
CASE State OF   
        0: (*Homing*)
                _39_PLC_set_digital_output_bus.8 := FALSE;
                Power := TRUE;
                IsHoming := TRUE;  
                TorqueEdge(CLK := (ABS(_90_Actual_torque_current) > HomingTorqueLimit));
                
                
                CASE HomingState OF 
                        00: (*Homing begins upwards in the positive direction*)
                                IF ((DI5Edge.Q) 
                                OR ((KeyRise.3 OR KeyRise.4 OR KeyRise.5) AND IsParBoxOn) 
                                OR (TorqueEdge.Q AND (_90_Actual_torque_current > 0))) THEN
                                        _39_PLC_set_digital_output_bus.8 := TRUE;
                                
                                        EndPos := _145_Actual_pos;
                                
                                        HomingState := HomingState + 1; 
                                END_IF;  
                                
                        01: (*Homing ends downwards in the negative direction*)
                                IF ((DI6Edge.Q) 
                                OR ((KeyRise.3 OR KeyRise.4 OR KeyRise.5) AND IsParBoxOn) 
                                OR (TorqueEdge.Q AND (_90_Actual_torque_current < 0))) THEN
                                        _39_PLC_set_digital_output_bus.8 := TRUE;
                                        
                                        EndPos := EndPos - _145_Actual_pos;
                        
                                        IF EndPos < (FloorDeadZone + TopDeadZone) THEN
                                                EndPos := FloorDeadZone + TopDeadZone;
                                        END_IF;
                        
                                        WritePos(EXECUTE:=FALSE);
                                        WritePos(
                                                EXECUTE := TRUE,
                                                PARAMETERNUMBER := 356,
                                                PARAMETERINDEX := 1,
                                                VALUE := EndPos,
                                                RAMONLY := 0);     
                                        
                                        HomingState := HomingState + 1;
                                END_IF;      
                END_CASE;
                
        1: (*Opening*)    
                IF Power AND NOT MoveExecute AND (TargetPos = EndPos) THEN
                        MoveExecute := TRUE;
                END_IF;

                IF (((_5_State_digital_input.0) OR (KeyRise.3 AND IsParBoxOn))) AND 
                (NOT ((_5_State_digital_input.1) OR (KeyRise.4 AND IsParBoxOn))) THEN
                        
                        TargetPos := EndPos;
                        SetFreq := RunFreq;     

                        IF NOT Power THEN
                                MoveExecute := FALSE;
                                Power := TRUE;
                        ELSE
                                MoveExecute := TRUE;
                        END_IF;
                END_IF;
                
                IF (FB_MoveAbs.Done) AND ((EndPos - _145_Actual_pos) < TopDeadZone) THEN 
                        Power := FALSE;
                        MoveExecute := FALSE; 
                        RestTimer(IN := FALSE);

                        State := 2; (*Reached top*)                       
                END_IF;
                
                IF ((_5_State_digital_input.1) OR (KeyRise.4 AND IsParBoxOn)) AND 
                (_145_Actual_pos > (FloorDeadZone * 105/100)) THEN
                
                        RestTimer(IN := FALSE);
                        MoveExecute := FALSE;

                        State := 3; (*Closing*)
                END_IF;
        
        2: (*Reached top*)
                RestTimer(IN := TRUE, PT := RestTime);
                JamCount := 0;
                
                IF ((RestTimer.Q) OR ((_5_State_digital_input.1) OR (KeyRise.4 AND IsParBoxOn))) AND 
                NOT (_5_State_digital_input.0 OR (_72_Parameterbox_key_state.3 AND IsParBoxOn)) THEN
                        
                        RestTimer(IN := FALSE);
                        MoveExecute := TRUE; 
                        
                        State := 3; (*Closing*)
                END_IF;  
                                                  
        3: (*Closing*)
                TargetPos := DINT#0;
                SetFreq := RunFreq;
                MoveExecute := TRUE;
        
                IF (_5_State_digital_input.0) OR (KeyRise.3 AND IsParBoxOn) THEN                        
                
                        TargetPos := EndPos;
                        MoveExecute := FALSE; 
                        SetFreq := RunFreq;
                        
                        State := 1;
                ELSE
                        Power := TRUE;
                END_IF; 

                                   
                IF ((FB_MoveAbs.Done) AND (_145_Actual_pos < FloorDeadZone)) THEN 
                        Power := FALSE;
                        
                        IF ((NOT _5_State_digital_input.1) OR (NOT (KeyRise.4 AND IsParBoxOn))) THEN
                                MoveExecute := FALSE;
                                JamCount := 0;
                                Init := FALSE;
                                State := 1; (*Opening*) 
                        END_IF;
                END_IF;
                
        4: (*ERROR STATE 1: Clear jam when going down*)
                IF NOT Power THEN
                        Power := TRUE;
                ELSE
                        MoveExecute := TRUE;
                END_IF;

                TargetPos := EndPos;
                SetFreq := ClearFreq;      
                                                                
                IF (FB_MoveAbs.Done) THEN
                
                        MoveExecute := FALSE;
                        State := 3; (*Closing*)       
                END_IF;        
                
        5, 6: (* Shared jam pause; retain distinct recovery actions. *)
                JamTimer(IN := TRUE, PT := JamTime);
                Power := FALSE;
                MoveExecute := FALSE;

                IF JamTimer.Q THEN
                        IF State = 6 THEN
                                TargetPos := EndPos;
                                SetFreq := ClearFreq;
                        END_IF;
                        Power := TRUE;
                        MoveExecute := TRUE;

                        IF State = 5 THEN
                                JamTimer(IN := FALSE);
                                State := 1;
                        ELSIF FB_MoveAbs.Done THEN
                                JamTimer(IN := FALSE);
                                MoveExecute := FALSE;
                                State := 3;
                        END_IF;
                END_IF;
END_CASE;

(*6. ------------------------------Fault clearing-----------------------------------*)
IF _72_Parameterbox_key_state.1 THEN
        _110_ErrorFlags.0 := FALSE;
        _110_ErrorFlags.1 := FALSE;
        _110_ErrorFlags.2 := FALSE;
        
        FB_MoveAbs(EXECUTE:= FALSE);
        Power := TRUE; 
        IsHoming := FALSE; 
        MoveExecute := FALSE;
        
        Init := FALSE;
        JamCount := 0;   
        State := 1;
                            
END_IF; 

IF JamCount >= MaxJams THEN
        _110_ErrorFlags.0 := TRUE;     
END_IF;

FB_Reset(EXECUTE := _72_Parameterbox_key_state.1);
 
(*7. ------------------------------Homing handling--------------------------------------*)
IF (_72_Parameterbox_key_state.0  AND _72_Parameterbox_key_state.5 AND IsParBoxOn)
AND (State = 1) AND (_88_Current_speed = 0) THEN
        Power := TRUE;
        HomingState := 0;
        IsHoming := TRUE;
        State := 0;
        
        MoveExecute := FALSE;
END_IF;                                

IF FB_Home.Done THEN
        IsHoming := FALSE;
        MoveExecute := FALSE;
        Power := FALSE;
        Init := FALSE;
        
        State := 1;
END_IF;

IF FB_Home.Error THEN
        IsHoming := FALSE;
        Power := FALSE;
        Init := FALSE;
        State := 1;
END_IF;

(*8. -----------------------------Movement, power and current position saving------------------------*)
FB_Power(ENABLE := Power);
IF NOT Power AND (_145_Actual_pos <= FloorDeadZone) THEN
        Init := FALSE;
END_IF;

IF FB_Power.Status THEN
        FB_MoveAbs(
                EXECUTE := MoveExecute AND Power AND NOT IsHoming, 
                POSITION := TargetPos, 
                VELOCITY := SetFreq, 
                MODE := 0
        );
        
        FB_Home(EXECUTE:=IsHoming,
                POSITION := 0,
                VELOCITY := HomeFreq,
                MODE := 16
        ); 
END_IF;
]]></Program><Checksum>3F517FFD4C338E7C6E0DF2F1A3D23D14D9C8078A5BCE81371D106EE6</Checksum></PLCFile></NordCon>
